This repository vendors the DilutionAttention harness (vendored.json) and adds a
Kimi Delta Attention layer (src/dilution/mixers.py) that follows the
flash-linear-attention implementation (https://github.com/fla-org/flash-linear-attention,
MIT License) and calls its Triton kernel. Kimi Delta Attention and the Kimi Linear
architecture are by Moonshot AI (arXiv 2510.26692).
